  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strengthened institutional capacity of employers&apos; organizations</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The ILO supports strengthened institutional and technical capacity of employers and their representative organizations in Sri Lanka to effectively contribute to inclusive and sustainable labour market outcomes. This includes improved organizational governance, policy analysis, and evidence-based advocacy, enabling employers to engage meaningfully in tripartite social dialogue and labour-related decision-making. Enhanced employer capacity contributes to increased compliance with international labour standards, improved workplace relations, and the adoption of responsible and productive business practices, ultimately supporting enterprise competitiveness, job creation, and decent work outcomes in Sri Lanka.</narrative>
  </description>
